  response response_compound_interest_report_en
    intent compound_interest_report
    language en
    text "Compound interest calculation\n\nFormula: A = P(1 + r/n)^(n*t)\nP = {principal} USD\nr = {rate} ({percent}% annual)\nn = {periods_per_year} ({frequency})\nt = {years} years\n\nStep 1: periodic rate = r/n = {rate}/{periods_per_year} = {periodic_rate}\nStep 2: number of periods = n*t = {periods_per_year}*{years} = {periods}\nStep 3: A = {principal} * (1 + {periodic_rate})^{periods}\nFinal amount: {final_amount} USD"
  response response_compound_interest_report_ru
    intent compound_interest_report
    language ru
    text "Расчёт сложных процентов\n\nФормула: A = P(1 + r/n)^(n*t)\nP = {principal} USD\nr = {rate} ({percent}% годовых)\nn = {periods_per_year} ({frequency})\nt = {years} лет\n\nШаг 1: ставка за период = r/n = {rate}/{periods_per_year} = {periodic_rate}\nШаг 2: число периодов = n*t = {periods_per_year}*{years} = {periods}\nШаг 3: A = {principal} * (1 + {periodic_rate})^{periods}\nИтоговая сумма: {final_amount} USD"
  response response_compound_interest_report_hi
    intent compound_interest_report
    language hi
    text "चक्रवृद्धि ब्याज की गणना\n\nसूत्र: A = P(1 + r/n)^(n*t)\nP = {principal} USD\nr = {rate} ({percent}% वार्षिक)\nn = {periods_per_year} ({frequency})\nt = {years} वर्ष\n\nचरण 1: आवधिक दर = r/n = {rate}/{periods_per_year} = {periodic_rate}\nचरण 2: अवधियों की संख्या = n*t = {periods_per_year}*{years} = {periods}\nचरण 3: A = {principal} * (1 + {periodic_rate})^{periods}\nअंतिम राशि: {final_amount} USD"
  response response_compound_interest_report_zh
    intent compound_interest_report
    language zh
    text "复利计算\n\n公式：A = P(1 + r/n)^(n*t)\nP = {principal} USD\nr = {rate}（年利率 {percent}%）\nn = {periods_per_year}（{frequency}）\nt = {years} 年\n\n第 1 步：每期利率 = r/n = {rate}/{periods_per_year} = {periodic_rate}\n第 2 步：期数 = n*t = {periods_per_year}*{years} = {periods}\n第 3 步：A = {principal} * (1 + {periodic_rate})^{periods}\n最终金额：{final_amount} USD"
  response response_compound_interest_report_es
    intent compound_interest_report
    language es
    text "Cálculo de interés compuesto\n\nFórmula: A = P(1 + r/n)^(n*t)\nP = {principal} USD\nr = {rate} ({percent}% anual)\nn = {periods_per_year} ({frequency})\nt = {years} años\n\nPaso 1: tasa por periodo = r/n = {rate}/{periods_per_year} = {periodic_rate}\nPaso 2: número de periodos = n*t = {periods_per_year}*{years} = {periods}\nPaso 3: A = {principal} * (1 + {periodic_rate})^{periods}\nImporte final: {final_amount} USD"
